The only runtime dependency is NumPy, installed separately under its own
license.

Autonomous Greenhouse Challenge data are not redistributed. The greenhouse
domain pack ships dataset descriptions (column names, units, file layouts),
task cards, an expert solver and notes from our own study of the data. The
data are published by Wageningen University & Research on 4TU.ResearchData:

  AGC 2018 cucumber  https://doi.org/10.4121/uuid:e4987a7b-04dd-4c89-9b18-883aad30ba9a
  AGC 2019 tomato    https://doi.org/10.4121/uuid:88d22c60-21b3-4ea8-90db-20249a5be2a7

Their use is subject to the terms published with each dataset.

The optional DSH agent transport runs a separately installed DeepSeek Harness
binary; it is not bundled. DSH, DeepSeek and other product names may be
trademarks of their respective owners; this project claims no endorsement.

LLM services, datasets and papers used with ecogym must be reviewed under
their own licenses and terms before use or redistribution.
